---
to: "formation/step-{{ order }}.md"
sparql:
  rows: |
    PREFIX kcf: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/knowing-christ-formation#>
    PREFIX dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/>
    PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
    SELECT ?order ?title ?definition ?practice (GROUP_CONCAT(?ref; separator=", ") AS ?scripture_refs) WHERE {
      ?step a kcf:FormationStep ;
            kcf:order ?order ;
            dcterms:title ?title ;
            skos:definition ?definition ;
            kcf:practice ?practice ;
            kcf:scriptureRef ?ref .
    }
    GROUP BY ?order ?title ?definition ?practice
    ORDER BY ?order
---
# {{ order }}. {{ title }}

**Scripture:** {{ scripture_refs }}

{{ definition }}

**Daily practice:** {{ practice }}

This is a formation prompt, not a spiritual score, revelation claim, or grant of pastoral authority.
